<title>UK: CRICKET-AUSTRALIA 249-6 IN 50 OVERS V ENGLAND.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIA 249-6 IN 50 OVERS V ENGLAND.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia scored 249 for six off</p>
<p>their 50 overs in the second one-day international against</p>
<p>England at the Oval on Saturday.</p>
</text>
